{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a perilous journey through three challenging acts where every decision shapes your destiny.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of survival in this intense roguelike action experience where strategic combat meets deep character progression. Navigate procedurally generated maps filled with diverse encounter types - from brutal combat arenas and mysterious treasure vaults to peaceful rest sites and merchant shops. Each playthrough offers a unique path through interconnected nodes that test your tactical prowess and adaptability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771950/extras/b22db9c996cff71b56025c47234c74d3.poster.avif?t=1773422819\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771950/extras/b22db9c996cff71b56025c47234c74d3.webm?t=1773422819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771950/extras/b22db9c996cff71b56025c47234c74d3.mp4?t=1773422819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Combat System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in timer-based combat encounters against waves of adaptive enemies that scale with your performance. Face off against common minions, formidable elite opponents, and devastating boss encounters, each with their own unique abilities and threat levels. The intelligent enemy spawning system responds to your playstyle, ensuring every battle remains challenging and engaging.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sigil Mastery &amp; Character Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and equip powerful <strong>Sigils</strong> - mystical artifacts that fundamentally alter your abilities and playstyle. From damage amplification and defensive matrices to time manipulation effects like the legendary Chronos Fragment, each Sigil offers game-changing passive and active abilities. Stack compatible Sigils to create devastating synergies or focus on specialized builds that suit your preferred combat approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771950/extras/4fa2f79c57f43bd2049b20ed1d5d8bbf.poster.avif?t=1773422819\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771950/extras/4fa2f79c57f43bd2049b20ed1d5d8bbf.webm?t=1773422819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771950/extras/4fa2f79c57f43bd2049b20ed1d5d8bbf.mp4?t=1773422819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Act Structure</strong>: Three acts with escalating difficulty and unique enemy pools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Difficulty</strong>: Smart systems that adjust challenge based on your performance and progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Node Variety</strong>: Combat encounters, treasure hunts, shops, rest areas, and mysterious events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Reward System</strong>: Stats scale dynamically with your progression through acts and stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Character Building</strong>: Combine Sigils and stat upgrades to create powerful, personalized builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong>: Every run offers new map layouts, enemy compositions, and Sigil combinations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771950/extras/7c48039b2074021993cef4194f6b4090.poster.avif?t=1773422819\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771950/extras/7c48039b2074021993cef4194f6b4090.webm?t=1773422819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771950/extras/7c48039b2074021993cef4194f6b4090.mp4?t=1773422819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience the Challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you prefer aggressive damage-focused builds, defensive tank strategies, or hybrid approaches with utility effects, the game's flexible progression system accommodates every playstyle. Master the timing of your abilities, exploit enemy weaknesses, and discover the perfect Sigil combinations to overcome increasingly dangerous threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you conquer all three acts and unlock the secrets that await at journey's end?</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ability Spammer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3771950/606977e50b65fa3bb0422b9abf10325192c4b06c.jpg"},{"name":"Armored Tank","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3771950/2097fbec79ee4aa20bb1026203d40d42e7335e34.jpg"},{"name":"Army of One","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3771950/ab7dd483876b30a696c422c695137c67aa00682e.jpg"},{"name":"Big Spender","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3771950/8140c6d9a7fb0726ab8c25e10b2b7566328228a0.jpg"},{"name":"Completionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3771950/3b3c43121f81f79e969e821c553aab95ba87fb8e.jpg"},{"name":"Critical Mass","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3771950/53ea97b4309dd5bdbdd63f7588580b95e04b8d72.jpg"},{"name":"Deathless","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3771950/99ed5c27da5cc209ada14852167eeca9d630a9f5.jpg"},{"name":"Elite Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3771950/dc9abc68daae137a9327edaaa5b191fbed45a0e6.jpg"},{"name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3771950/dcb6bc3f89df4824e1ee269ed90b8cbb81055a31.jpg"},{"name":"Forge Apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3771950/1996e7959b778906f19db2dc4c05c6b2ca607a0e.jpg"}],"total":44},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3771950?t=1773422819","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771950/c899e10db93557a59478e2c73266be3379f220d5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773422819","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771950/23e2bd7a55d4b3f08945e60cbe215d56b8ed4398/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773422819","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771950/23e2bd7a55d4b3f08945e60cbe215d56b8ed4398/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773422819","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a perilous journey through three challenging acts where every decision shapes your destiny.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Experience</h2><